${goto 2}${color DimGray}CPU 1: ${goto 45}${if_match ${cpu cpu1} > 90}${color red}${else}$color${endif}${cpu cpu1}% ${goto 74}${color2}${cpubar cpu1 5, 72} ${goto 154}${color DimGray}CPU 2: ${goto 197}${if_match ${cpu cpu2} > 90}${color red}${else}$color${endif}${cpu cpu2}% ${goto 226}${color2}${cpubar cpu2 5, 82}
