${goto 2}${color DimGray}CPU 5: ${goto 45}${if_match ${cpu cpu5} > 90}${color red}${else}$color${endif}${cpu cpu5}% ${goto 74}${color2}${cpubar cpu5 5, 72} ${goto 154}${color DimGray}CPU 6: ${goto 197}${if_match ${cpu cpu6} > 90}${color red}${else}$color${endif}${cpu cpu6}% ${goto 226}${color2}${cpubar cpu6 5, 82}
