${color DimGray}Downloaded: ${color white}${totaldown enp6s0}${alignr}${color white}${totalup enp6s0} ${color DimGray}Uploaded${else}$font${color DimGray}Local IP (WiFi) $alignr ${color white}${addr wlp7s0}
${color DimGray}Down: ${color white}${downspeed wlp7s0}${alignr}${color white}${upspeed wlp7s0} ${color DimGray}Up
${color DimGray}Downloaded: ${color white}${totaldown wlp7s0}${alignr}${color white}${totalup wlp7s0} ${color DimGray}Uploaded${endif}

